{% comment %} Shipping Information Page {% endcomment %}
<div class="simple-page">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="simple-page-content">
      <h1 class="simple-page-title">Shipping Information</h1>

      <div class="simple-page-block">
        <h2>Digital Delivery — Instant & Free</h2>
        <p>All Barnhaus floor plans are digital products. There is nothing to ship. Once your order is confirmed, your plan package is delivered directly to the email address on your order — typically within minutes.</p>
        <p>Please check your spam or promotions folder if you don't see it within 15 minutes. If you still haven't received your files after 30 minutes, contact us at <a href="mailto:larry@barnhaussteelbuilders.com">larry@barnhaussteelbuilders.com</a> and we'll get it sorted immediately.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="simple-page-block">
        <h2>What You'll Receive</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Planning Study Set:</strong> PDF file delivered via email link. Includes dimensioned floor plans, elevation views, and 3D dollhouse visualization sheets.</li>
          <li><strong>Complete Construction Set:</strong> Full PDF blueprint package delivered via email link. Includes all architectural drawings, plans, and schedules as described in your product listing.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="simple-page-block">
        <h2>File Format</h2>
        <p>All plans are delivered as high-resolution PDF files, compatible with any device, tablet, phone, or computer. No special software required.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="simple-page-block">
        <h2>Questions?</h2>
        <p>Reach us at <a href="mailto:larry@barnhaussteelbuilders.com">larry@barnhaussteelbuilders.com</a> or call <a href="tel:2105177267">(210) 517-7267</a>. We typically respond within a few hours during business hours (Mon–Fri, 8AM–6PM CST).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
.simple-page { padding: 60px 0; }
.simple-page-content { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
.simple-page-title { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 40px; border-bottom: 2px solid #B8860B; padding-bottom: 16px; }
.simple-page-block { margin-bottom: 36px; }
.simple-page-block h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #B8860B; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.simple-page-block p { color: #ccc; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.simple-page-block ul { padding-left: 20px; }
.simple-page-block ul li { color: #ccc; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.simple-page-block a { color: #B8860B; text-decoration: underline; }
</style>

